  "title": "Pixel Tag Launch and Google's AI-Enhanced Pixel Series",
  "summary": "Google has announced the Pixel Tag, a $30 Android-ready tracker, and the Pixel 11 series, featuring AI integration and new features, with the Pixel Tag launching as part of its Made by Google event. The Pixel Tag works with Google's existing tracking network and app, similar to Apple's AirTag.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Google's Pixel Tag is now available for purchase with a price similar to Apple's AirTag.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Pixel Tag is designed to integrate with Google's Find Hub app and existing tracking network.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Pixel 11 series features AI capabilities and new camera, health, and translation tools.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
